The task: the inverse of 42 modulo 2017 is 1969

More cases (those of the C and Phix entries, and two past 64 bits):
  the inverse of 42 modulo 2017 is 1969  (42 * 1969 mod 2017 = 1)
  the inverse of 40 modulo 1 is 0  (40 * 0 mod 1 = 0)
  the inverse of 52 modulo -217 is 96  (52 * 96 mod 217 = 1)
  the inverse of -486 modulo 217 is 121  (-486 * 121 mod 217 = 1)
  40 is not invertible modulo 2018 (both are multiples of 2)
  the inverse of 1000000000000000000000000000007 modulo 618970019642690137449562111 is 207061217366611539933161615  (1000000000000000000000000000007 * 207061217366611539933161615 mod 618970019642690137449562111 = 1)
  the inverse of 515377520732011331036461129765621272702107522001 modulo 10000000000000000000000000000000000000001 is 868663852837274559587470696293411311032  (515377520732011331036461129765621272702107522001 * 868663852837274559587470696293411311032 mod 10000000000000000000000000000000000000001 = 1)
